    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda asazeegho okubonereza ensi Haduraki n'ekibuga ky'e Damasiko. Era ekibuga kya Siria ekikulu kya Musengwa Katonda oyo, n'ebika byonabyona eby'omu Isiraeli byona bibye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamathi ekigabana ensalosalo ni Haduraki kya Musengwa Katonda oyo, ni Tiro ni Sidoni ebirimu abantu abagezi einho byona bibye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiro kyamala okwezimbaku ekimante ekigumu okukyezungulula, kyabunga feeza omungi ng'oti nkungu, ni zaabu omungi ng'oti bityanka bya mu nguudo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bona eno, Musengwa Katonda alikitoolaku ebintu byakyo byonabyona, yaawoloba obukombe bwakyo mu nhandha. Era omuliro gulyokya ekibuga ekyo gwakisaaniagho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
