                "loc": "ZEP.2.4+ZEP.2.5+ZEP.2.6+ZEP.2.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zef 2:4-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekibuga Ashikeloni kiribona ebyo, kyatya. Gaza kiritengera olw'obulumi, ni Ekuroni kyona kyalumwa okubona ng'eisuubi lyakyo liwoiregho. Gaza kirifiirwa kyabazinga waakyo, ni Ashikeloni kyasigala agho kityo nga kiziramu bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu Ashidodi mulibaamu abantu ab'omusaayi omutabike. Era Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Ndireetera Abafilisiti abo abeetwala okuba aba ghaigulu, okwewombeeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndibalekeza okuliira omusaayi mu mamba, n'okulya ebintu ebindi byonabyona ebyenhinhalwa. Abaliwonagho boona balitwalibwa ng'abantu bange, baaba ng'oti n'ekindi ku bika kya Yuda. Abantu ab'e Ekuroni boona balifuuka bantu bange, ng'Abayebusi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:7:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abayebusi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abo n'abantu abaayagaanibwa mu Yerusalemu nga batyamye baamu, abaamala ni bagondera kyabazinga Daudi ng'aghangwire ekibuga ekyo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bwe baafuuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo ndibanga mu nsi yange eyo ng'omukuumi waayo, ndobere abazigu okugibitamu. Tija kuganha mufuzi mubi kabiri kutuntuza bantu bange, kuba mpegaano nze mwene mboine n'amaiso gange, abantu bange nga bwe badaazibwadaazibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
